      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STEAL THE STAGE (4) has a strong winning strike-rate this journey having won three of four starts. Was out of placings last time (34.75) at this track in a Special conditions H, finishing fourth and beaten 9 lengths. Looks suited and should go close. OPAWA EMILY (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (34.94) last time in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Has a solid record from this box including three wins and a minor placing. Has ability and can atone. WEBLEC MEMPHIS (6) hit the ground running last start and was never headed (34.45) at Sandown in Grade 4/5 over 595m. Ran the fastest time on the program in his latest win. Can make it two on the bounce. POINT BREAK (5) hit the frame latest (30.04) when third at this track in a Mix 3/4. Has two wins already from this draw.",
